<title>LEBANON: Lebanese CPI up 2.48 pct in Feb - Banks Assn.</title>
<headline>Lebanese CPI up 2.48 pct in Feb - Banks Assn.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanese consumer prices rose 2.48 percent in February, according to figures issued on Thursday by the Lebanese Banks Association.</p>
<p>The Association issued the following figures for the Consumer Price Index (Dec 1994 = 100):</p>
<p>		  Feb 97   Jan 97   Dec 96</p>
<p>		  125.11   122.08   118.64</p>
<p>Monthly Changes (%)</p>
<p>		   2.48     2.90     0.91</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057</p>
</text>
